OL,3,GNEWSA'I lost everything over sex       
OL,4,Aassault allegation'                    
OL,6,FA TV pundit and former England rugby   
OL,7,Fleague player cleared of sexual assault
OL,8,Fhas said she "lost everything" over the
OL,9,Fallegation.                            
OL,11,FDanika Priim, 42, had been accused of  
OL,12,Fputting her hand up a woman's skirt at 
OL,13,FHorsforth Cricket Club, Leeds, in July 
OL,14,F2022 but was found not guilty on       
OL,15,FThursday following a three-day trial.  
OL,17,FSpeaking to the BBC after the verdict, 
OL,18,FPriim, who played for Bradford Bulls   
OL,19,Fand Leeds Rhinos, said the subsequent  
OL,20,Ffour years have been "the most         
OL,21,Fhorrendous time of life".              
