OL,3,GNEWSA'I lost everything over sex       
OL,4,Aassault allegation'                    
OL,6,F"I got to a really low point ` there   
OL,7,Fare points where I wasn't sure I'd     
OL,8,Fstill be here, which is a difficult    
OL,9,Fpart to say," she added.               
